<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Intellij on Carlos A. Gomes</title><link>https://carlos-algms.github.io/blog/tags/intellij/</link><description>Recent content in Intellij on Carlos A. Gomes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>pt-BR</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 30 Jan 2016 18:39:37 -0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://carlos-algms.github.io/blog/tags/intellij/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>como utilizar o cygwin como terminal no intellij</title><link>https://carlos-algms.github.io/blog/como-utilizar-o-cygwin-como-terminal-no-intellij/</link><pubDate>Sat, 30 Jan 2016 18:39:37 -0200</pubDate><guid>https://carlos-algms.github.io/blog/como-utilizar-o-cygwin-como-terminal-no-intellij/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Para o intelliJ abrir um terminal bash corretamente no windows, crie um arquivo &lt;code&gt;.bat&lt;/code&gt; com os seguintes comandos:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Se você instalou a versão 64 bits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bat" data-lang="bat"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;@&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; off
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;set&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;CHERE_INVOKING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;1 &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; c:\cygwin64\bin\bash.exe --login -i
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Para versão 32 bits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bat" data-lang="bat"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;@&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;echo&lt;/span&gt; off
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="ln"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;set&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;CHERE_INVOKING&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;1 &lt;span class="p"&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; c:\cygwin\bin\bash.exe --login -i
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="configurar-o-intellij"&gt;Configurar o intelliJ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No intelliJ, &lt;code&gt;File -&amp;gt; Setting -&amp;gt; Tools -&amp;gt; Terminal&lt;/code&gt;, e altere o terminal para o arquivo que você criou:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://carlos-algms.github.io/blog/como-utilizar-o-cygwin-como-terminal-no-intellij/intellij-config-terminal.jpg" alt="Print configuração do terminal intelliJ"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pronto, feche o terminal do intelliJ e abra novamente que já será o terminal bash.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>